WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.440
I want them all to come.

00:00:01.440 --> 00:00:05.320
I believe the best way in which we can demonstrate resistance

00:00:05.320 --> 00:00:09.120
is not bending the knee to tyranny.

00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:11.200
Tyranny is when you're too afraid to leave

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:13.280
your house on the South Side.

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:15.840
Americans fear crime, not ICE.

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:19.459
Illegals fear ICE, and they should, especially now

00:00:19.459 --> 00:00:22.520
that Greg Abbott's sending the National Guard to Chicago.

00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:24.879
First Abbott bust Biden migrants into Illinois

00:00:24.879 --> 00:00:27.559
to make blue states feel like border states.

00:00:27.559 --> 00:00:29.320
That kind of helped Trump win the election.

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:31.959
Now Trump says, Abbott, can you send the Guard back

00:00:31.959 --> 00:00:34.200
to pick them up and take them home?

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:36.880
200 troops are rolling in, and Pritzker's

00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:39.240
calling them the N-word.

